--- !u!1001 &1123897184580128426
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 6130619408239251317}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 2116517601969916342, guid: 183e809bca3827e41a67b7345a91f0c2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Video game graphics would be brought to a standstill due to Atari''s
        market loss in the crash. Nintendo and SEGA''s expanding stake in the market
        increased the standards for video game graphics brought by the company''s
        practices.


        Instead of settling to sell oversaturated and rushed
        games by the numbers, games made under these companies would prioritize polish
        to order to sell and appeal to customers/enjoyers through quality product,
        such as all legal games on Nintendo consoles requiring an official Seal of
        Approval.


        Any new generation consoles created moving forward would
        prioritize attempting to achieve the highest technological standards possible.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2116517601969916342, guid: 183e809bca3827e41a67b7345a91f0c2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 0.05
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2116517601969916342, guid: 183e809bca3827e41a67b7345a91f0c2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSizeBase
      value: 0.05
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3395319288993390409, guid: 183e809bca3827e41a67b7345a91f0c2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Plaque_ET_CrashEffects
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
