    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 2116517601969916342, guid: 183e809bca3827e41a67b7345a91f0c2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The Atari 2600, also known as the Atari VCS brought about many innovations
        to the console industry, including 8-bit graphics, supporting a 128 color
        palette and storable game cartridges.


        It sold 26 million units,
        its success as a result of its advanced technology (at the time) and allowing
        third-party developers, such as the newly formed Activision to produce games
        for the console.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
